  "metadata": {
    "alignment": "unspecified",
    "description": "Official NVIDIA profile, matching eugr\u2019s Bolt recipe: tested image digest 4428520b, checkpoint c6cc2e8f and LiLiCorr 4c6a5613; eight streams, automatic context fit, FP8 KV and seven-token DFlash. Preserves instanttensor loading, Mamba shared-prefix checkpoints and NVIDIA reasoning/tool parsers. Memory is a conservative per-node estimate, not a local measurement. Publication does not establish physical Spark qualification. The managed profile caps GPU utilization at 0.7 to include separate-drafter overhead and the platform OS floor; this capacity adjustment has not been physically qualified. GB10 host-guard headroom: explicit engine reservation capped at 0.60; budget includes runtime overhead and leaves at least 16 GiB of the lower observed idle MemAvailable free. Smaller KV pool; context and model pins retained. Resource envelopes remain conservative estimates; physical requalification is pending.",
    "tags": [
      "nemotron",
      "vllm",
      "spark",
      "tool-use",
      "reasoning",
      "vision"
    ],
